    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bagibeoni kūmala shiilī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū ja būsugi wakwe ū Daūdi, īkagwa nzala yūbakoya ikanza lya myaka idatū; nose ū Daūdi ūkooba kūmana kūfuma kūlī SEEBA. Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla, “Ī yenīyī īlīmukoya kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa Saulo na kaya yakwe; nguno ya mininga ayo wagiita kūlwa kūbabūlaga Bagibeoni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Daūdi ūbitana a Bagibeoni ūhooya nabo. (A Bagibeoni benebo baalī batī Baisilaeli, baalī basaagīīla kūfuma ng'wihanga lya Baamooli; a Baisilaeli baalī babilahīlīla gīkī batūbayagaja babamale, alīyo ū Saulo kulwa kūtogwa kūbayeja a Baisilaeli na a banhū ba Yuda, ūbeeja mbika ya kūbabūlaga pye a Bagibeoni bashile gete.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Daūdi ūbabūūja a Bagibeoni benabo, “Namubeegeje mhayo kī? Mhayo kī ūyo nang'wītīle gūmuyeje mubūlombele ū wingīji wa banhū ba ng'wa SEEBA?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Bagibeoni būshosha balīhaya, “A bise tūtūkoobaga feza nūūlū zahabu kūfuma kūlī Saulo nūūlū kūfuma mu kaya yakwe, nīyo a bise tūtī na būdūla wa kūmūlaga munhū ose ose ū mu Isilaeli.” Ū Daūdi ūbabūūja hangī, “Mulītogwa nang'wītīle mhayo kī lūūlū ī gīsī?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būnshokeja ū ntemi balīhaya, “Ū munhū ū nkenaagūji ūyo walī na ng'hūmbū ja kūtūyagaja nose tūmalwa gīkī, kūshisha ī haha tūtī n'ipandī hose hose ū mu sī ya Isilaeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ū munhū ng'wenūyo tūtogilwe twinhwe bagosha mpungatī ba shibyalīlwe shakwe tūkababūlagīle Gibea ya ng'wa Saulo ū nsolwa o ng'wa SEEBA, hūna tūbatendegese kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi ūnang'hana ū Mefi-boshesi ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yonasani ng'witūnja o ng'wa Saulo, ū ng'wenūyo ūneka ikale mpanga kūlwa nguno ū Daūdi nū Yonasani ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Saulo baalī biyilahīlīla kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūbasola ba Alimoni na Mefi-boshesi, bitūnja ba ng'wa Aiya nshīke o ng'wa Lisipa; a basūmba benabo walī wamyalīla Saulo. Ū ntemi ūbasola na bitūnja batanò ba ng'wa Melabu, walī wamyalīla Adilieli ng'witūnja o ng'wa Bazilai muna Mehola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi ūbafunya a banhū benabo, ūbinha a Bagibeoni būbabūlaga hūna būbatendegesa mu lūgūlū kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA. Bose mpungatī būcha lūshikū lūmò; būbūlagwa mu shikū ja wandījo wa makanza ga magesa, aho gakandījaga magesa ga būsīga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Saulo na Yonasani kūjīkwa Zeelà",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Lisipa ū nshīke o ng'wa Aiya ūsola magūnīla wamba hiwe, ga kūyūlaalīla. Atīngile hoi kūfuma ikanza lya kwandya magesa kūshisha yūtūlwa mbula ī mibimba; wikalaga henaho pye a makanza akūlang'hanaga, ī līīmi wajipuuga ī noni jitizūgwa hoi, nī būjikū wajilang'hanaga ī shiinu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi aho wawīlwa ūmo wītīlaga ū nshīke o ng'wa Aiya ū Lisipa, ūyo walī nke ndo o ng'wa Saulo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūja ū kū banhū ba Yabeshi-gileadi ūūkageenha a maguha ga ng'wa Saulo na a ga ng'wa Yonasani. (A banhū benabo baalī bīyīnja ī mibimba ī Beeti-shani, bīsola mu wiba wiba ū kwīnga ū mu gwalugwa ya mu nzengo, ūko baalī bīnungeleja a Bafilisiti aho bamūlaga ū Saulo ī Giliboa.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Daūdi ūgīnja koi a maguha ga ng'wa Saulo na a ga ng'witūnja wakwe ū Yonasani; na a ga banhū abo baalī babūlagwa hūna būtendegeswa ha ng'wape benabo, gūkumingwa nago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A maguha ga ng'wa Saulo na a ga ng'witūnja wakwe ū Yonasani būūkagajīkīla Zeelà mu sī ya Benjamini, mu shigila sha ng'wa Kishi ise o ng'wa Saulo; bīīta yose gīt'ūmo akabalagīīla ū ntemi. Hanuma ya henaho ū SEEBA hū wigwa ū kūlomba kwa banhū bakwe aho bakwīlombelaga ī sī yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būlūgū na Bafilisiti hangī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwimanīla wabūūka būlūgū hangī a ha gatī ya Bafilisiti na a Baisilaeli. Ū Daūdi ūtulumenha ajile na a banhū bakwe, ūūkandya kūlwa nabo a Bafilisiti; ū Daūdi ūnoga no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lyalīho idaaji ū mu Bafilisiti litanagwa lī Ishi-benobu, lya kūfuma mu būbyīle bo ng'wa Lafa; ī chūma sha h'ichimu lyalyo shalī na būdito bo kilo idatū na nusu, hama lyalī na lī lūshū ipya. Ī ling'wana lyenīlo līkangwakwabīla ū Daūdi, lyūsangwa lyahaya kūmūlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo wangūhīlwa na Abishai ng'wana Seluya hū ūnguna ng'wenūyo, ūlītūla ī Līfilisiti lyenīlo ūlībūlaga. Na lūūlū a banhū bakwe ū Daūdi būng'wīla, nīyo būng'wilahīlīla, “Ū bebe yaya lūūlū ū kūfuma hamò nise hangī kūja kū būlūgū, ītizūjimiwa ī tala ya mu Isilaeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shikū jitabītile ningī būgwa būlūgū hangī a ha gatī ya Bafilisiti na a Baisilaeli ipandī lya Gobu. Ī likanza lyenīlo Sibeka muna Hushai ūlībūlaga lī Safu, nalyo lyalī lya kūfuma mu būbyīle bo ng'wa Lafa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikanza līngī hangī balwaaga na a Bafilisiti kūko Gobu kwenūko, Elihanani ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yaale-olegimu muna Betelehemu ūlībūlaga lī Goliati lya Gaasi, īlo mpīni gw'ichimu lyalyo lyalī līnang'ha itaale no, hangī igīnu gītī ng'wīsī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu būlūgū būngī balwīlaga Gaasi, lyalīho idaaji lya nzwaala itandatū tandatū, ū kū makono nū kū mhambala, ī jose jalī nzwaala makūmi abīlī n'inè; nalyo lyalī lya kūfuma mu būbyīle bo ng'wa Lafa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lyandya kūbasondagūla a Baisilaeli; ūlisanga Yonasani ng'witūnja o ng'wa Shimea, nkūlūye o ng'wa Daūdi, ūlībūlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A madaaji būnè wago genaya gaalī ma muna Gaasi, gaalī ga kūfuma mu būbyīle bo ng'wa Lafa; a gose gakabūlagwa ha sīlīlī ya nkono go ng'wa Daūdi, na banhū bakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
